abstract: "Engineering-contract architecture and comparative simulation evidence. The archived v0.3.0 studies are retained. Added evidence includes 28 paired whole-process cases, a two-agent adapter pilot with a disclosed post hoc repair, and four provider-integration implementations across two schema changes. Acceptance reruns use stored solved fixtures. A minimal numerical subset separately regenerates later physical baselines; fresh metadata timing is supported. The full later mechanical/ontology-runtime environment is excluded. No ontology-specific maintenance advantage, human-effort benefit or plant validation is established."
